{"steam_appid":3446190,"steam_name":"Hatsune Miku Logic Paint S+","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3446190/1677316779/56d5f71282a0a95b93bf87f70bb3ecfe95ecb6af/1779873608/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1783562443","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257343918/46ea844e5498396e803de6713445d15eb0d20342/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1783562443","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/5fe52c397fb60fdd248eab95bc2b8b8efcb275e4/ss_5fe52c397fb60fdd248eab95bc2b8b8efcb275e4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783580881","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/262c7d7d67a011eab9e730071c3737e41e178ffb/ss_262c7d7d67a011eab9e730071c3737e41e178ffb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783580881","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/15ae36ac61f31c63574183963508c569c68edbcf/ss_15ae36ac61f31c63574183963508c569c68edbcf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783580881","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/bafca2dce18868537cd1661955ab7b4c2ae92e67/ss_bafca2dce18868537cd1661955ab7b4c2ae92e67.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783580881","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/fbfc0e47afc2bfe796b78b34d724d4569549fd97/ss_fbfc0e47afc2bfe796b78b34d724d4569549fd97.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783580881"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This new and improved version of Hatsune Miku Logic Paint S includes a variety of new features!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work alongside Miku and other Piapro characters to solve these unique puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatsune Miku Logic Paint S+ New Features multiple new puzzles have been added to the previous title!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the Normal Puzzles and all-new illustration-based Special Puzzles, you can also update the appearance of each Piapro character, and even customize your room to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/extras/5874f1a8905d98ed2ba404c826758c42.poster.avif?t=1783580881\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/extras/5874f1a8905d98ed2ba404c826758c42.webm?t=1783580881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/extras/5874f1a8905d98ed2ba404c826758c42.mp4?t=1783580881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◇Immerse yourself in the puzzle-solving action with more than twice the content of the  previous game, including more than 1,000 new puzzles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your hand at 10x10, 15x15, and even 20x20 puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete stages with each character to unlock new costumes, room items, and even more gorgeous artwork!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the 75x75 Special Puzzles from the previous game, this updated version includes even more challenging 100x100 puzzles as well!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also more than 30 illustrations from popular illustrators to enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◇New Features!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/extras/b0b39bb78b2b4c1d6fe42029032d48f7.poster.avif?t=1783580881\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/extras/b0b39bb78b2b4c1d6fe42029032d48f7.webm?t=1783580881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/extras/b0b39bb78b2b4c1d6fe42029032d48f7.mp4?t=1783580881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change your characters' costumes and freely customize your room as you take on these puzzles with your favorite characters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like the last game, Miku and the other Piapro characters will cheer you on as you solve these challenging puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/extras/0cf4ff9cce65b711109d35d30caa682a.poster.avif?t=1783580881\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/extras/0cf4ff9cce65b711109d35d30caa682a.webm?t=1783580881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/extras/0cf4ff9cce65b711109d35d30caa682a.mp4?t=1783580881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Best of all, this game has added all-new costume and room editing features!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/extras/365fb527209b68d5ace121eef34d9678.poster.avif?t=1783580881\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/extras/365fb527209b68d5ace121eef34d9678.webm?t=1783580881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/extras/365fb527209b68d5ace121eef34d9678.mp4?t=1783580881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dress up the characters in various outfits and rearrange your room in order to better enjoy your puzzle-solving adventures!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/extras/d10b1d3c8f6c1f8a892dd3dfd1fbfb1c.poster.avif?t=1783580881\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/extras/d10b1d3c8f6c1f8a892dd3dfd1fbfb1c.webm?t=1783580881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446190/extras/d10b1d3c8f6c1f8a892dd3dfd1fbfb1c.mp4?t=1783580881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◇Includes special fan-made songs officially chosen by Piapro!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes 30 songs that were specially selected from fan submissions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the puzzle missions and collect “stars” along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect enough stars to unlock new songs! ♪</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy your puzzles while listening to your favorite songs on the home and puzzle screens!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◇What is Hatsune Miku Logic Paint?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the numbers above and to the left of the puzzles as hints to color in the appropriate squares and complete the illustration to solve them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The handy &quot;X&quot; feature lets you block out squares to keep track of those that shouldn't be colored in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can always review the basic rules within the game if you ever need a refresher course!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit or Later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX Version 11 compatible video<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Casual"],"developers":["Crypton Future Media"],"publishers":["KOMODO"],"release_date":"23 Jul, 2025"}